Package: PGlicko
Type: Package
Title: Glicko and Pairwise Glicko (P-Glicko) Rating Systems for Intransitive Competitions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("K.H.", "Wong", , "kinhang@wayne.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rates players in head-to-head competitions with the Glicko system
    and with P-Glicko, an extension that adds a pairwise strength and a pairwise
    rating deviation for every pair of players, so that win probabilities need not
    be transitive (A can be favoured over B, B over C and C over A). Ratings are
    updated period by period, with Glicko rating-deviation growth between periods.
    Includes maximum-likelihood fitting of the initial deviations, walk-forward
    prediction, evaluation on held-out periods, and continuation of a rating run
    with new data. Pairwise parameters are stored only for pairs that have played,
    so memory grows with the number of pairs that meet, not with the square of the
    number of players.
